join Zanele (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Zanele (Warm)
- How many do you teach?
	Hope: How many do you teach?
	Zanele: It depends what you mean by teach, which is not me being difficult — it genuinely has three answers.
	Zanele: Nine come every day. Another six or seven come when their households can spare them, which is fewer in the dry season and more after the rains.
	Zanele: And there are four I would call students who have not been here since March, because the water queue takes their mornings.
	Zanele: So: nine, sixteen, or twenty. I count all three, because forgetting the last four is how you end up teaching nine forever.
set {GameState.zanele_ambient_12_toggle} = true
